<Doc title="Privacy" lede="What we collect and what we do with it.">
  <div class="callout"><p><strong>Draft.</strong> This page is a plain-language starting point and should be reviewed against your final email, payment and analytics providers before launch.</p></div>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Your email address,</strong> if you sign up for a guide, the newsletter or a waitlist.</li>
    <li><strong>Order details,</strong> if you buy a digital product. Payments are handled by our payment processor. We never see or store your card number.</li>
    <li><strong>Basic usage data,</strong> such as which pages are visited, to help us improve the site.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What we do with it</h2>
  <p>We use your email to send what you asked for and our weekly email. We do not sell your information. Every email has an unsubscribe link.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>When you follow a link to a retailer, that retailer may use cookies to record that you came from us. Their own privacy policy applies on their site.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete the information we hold about you by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@thebiologicaledge.com">hello@thebiologicaledge.com</a>.</p>
</Doc>
